<center>
<h1>Airfoil Lifting Force Misconception<br>
Widespread in <a href="/miscon/k6.txt">K-6</a> Textbooks</h1>
<a href="/me.html">William Beaty</a> 1996</h1>
</center>



<table width=100%><tr>
<td width=15% valign=top><font size=3>
&ordm;&nbsp;<a href="/wing/airfoil.html#parts">Misconceptions</a><br>
&ordm;&nbsp;<a href="/wing/airfoil.html#articles">Articles Here</a><br>
&ordm;&nbsp;<a href="/wing/airgif2.html">GIF Diagrams</a><br>
&ordm;&nbsp;<a href="/wing/airfoil.html#L1">Links</a><br>
&ordm;&nbsp;<a href="/wing/airfoil.html#refs">Refs</a>
